{"unit_id":"tag:0D15:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一阶加厚（first order thickening），其理想（ideal）层（sheaf）为<MATH_0004>；我们将其视为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0005>-模（module），或视为<MATH_0006>上的拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals），见《空间态射（Morphisms）的进一步讨论》第<REF_0001>节。设<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>-模（modules）的同态（homomorphism）（不必拟凝聚（quasi-coherent））。设<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>-模（modules）的映射（map），并用<MATH_0013>表示其复合（composition）。考虑由推出（pushout）给出的函子（functor）\n<MATHSEG_0001>解（solutions），满足 <MATHSEG_0002> 对于 <MATHSEG_0003> 和 <MATHSEG_0004>解（solutions），满足 <MATHSEG_0005> 对于 <MATHSEG_0006> 和 <MATHSEG_0007>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals","target_term":"拟凝聚理想层"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"空词表；概形暂定。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"first order thicke